      (1) security-roles.md §9: no privilege change required for the writer's CURRENT (sprk_matter-subject) scope — the existing union already covers it. Recommend (not applied) folding prvWritesprk_Signal into Spaarke Ontology Service directly, so the writer's privilege set is self-contained.
      (2) F26 (new): grant AppendTo on sprk_communication to Spaarke Ontology Service before any sprk_communication-subject rule is authored — today it fails at write time with a 403.
